            "Exhaus",
            "Transfer of Heat",
            "POINT TO PONDER",
            "Blow warm air onto your hand from your wide-open mouth. Now reduce the opening between your lips so that the air expands as you blow. Do you notice a difference in the",
            "air temperature? Why?",
            "POINT TO PONDER",
