    "comparison": "Fresh rendered-page review: restored missing standalone screw-gauge object at approximately 59% content-column width; Figure 1.3 remains almost full width. Preserved definition quotes, distinct headings, pitch/least-count prose and e.g. label; replaced flattened equations with fraction bars. Added circular-scale numbers 5/0/45 and translated seven source pointers, preserving datum wording.",
