            "text": "For example when teacher changes her position in the classroom while students are sitting on their chairs. According to students observation the teacher is in motion. Interestingly, teacher while moving also observes the students to move as well. Similarly, when Sara leaves in train and her cousin John sees her off. As the train starts moving Sara see John moving to the right, (as shown in the figure 2.1) with same speed as John see Sara moving to the left.",
