    "comparison": "Fresh source-page and 3.2x crop inspection. Corrected entirely different legacy Example 2.1 to original snail question, 330mm/140s data, fractions and printed answer. Preserved source errors 0.000066km/h and equation2.3 with separated editorial note. Reconstructed snail and Bolt photo subjects as native shapes at .32/.28 source ratios; all source headings, extension questions, fastest-man assignment and cricket-bowling activity explicitly translated. No assignment/extension/activity solutions invented.",
    "definitions": [
      {
        "term": "Uniform Speed",
        "definition": "‘If a body covers equal distances in equal intervals of time we say that the speed is uniform’.",
        "urdu": "اگر جسم برابر وقفوں میں برابر فاصلے طے کرے تو ہم کہتے ہیں کہ رفتار یکساں ہے۔",
        "pashto": "که یو جسم د وخت په برابرو واټنونو کې برابر واټنونه ووهي، وایو چې چټکتیا یوشان ده.",
        "sourcePdfPage": 42,
        "sourcePrintedPage": 37
      }
    ],
