        "num": "2.2",
        "name": "STRAIGHT ROAD",
        "statement": "A straight track is 1200 m in length. A runner begins at the starting line, runs due east for the full length of the track, turns around and runs halfway back. The time for this run is five minutes. What is her (a) average velocity, and (b) average speed?",
        "given": "Distance covered s = 1200 m + 600 m = 1800 m\nDisplacement Δs = 1200 m - 600 m = 600 m\ntime Δt = 5 min = (5 × 60 s) = 300 s",
        "required": "(a) average speed ⟨v⟩ = ?\n(b) average velocity ⟨v⃗⟩ = ?",
        "formula": "<div style=\"max-width:230px\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 210 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Textbook equation\"><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"64\">&lt; v⃗ &gt; =</text><text x=\"155.0\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\">s⃗</text><text x=\"155.0\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">t</text><path d=\"M135 54h40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 210 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Textbook equation\"><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"64\">&lt; v &gt; =</text><text x=\"155.0\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\">s</text><text x=\"155.0\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">t</text><path d=\"M135 54h40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div>",
        "solution": "<div style=\"max-width:260px\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 350 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Textbook equation\"><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"64\">&lt; v⃗ &gt; =</text><text x=\"217.5\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\">600 m (East)</text><text x=\"217.5\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">300 s</text><path d=\"M135 54h165\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 295 110\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Textbook equation\"><g font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"64\">&lt; v &gt; =</text><text x=\"192.5\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1800 m</text><text x=\"192.5\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\">300 s</text><path d=\"M135 54h115\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g></svg></div>",
        "answer": "Her average velocity is 2 m/s East, while her average speed is 6 m/s.",
        "sourcePendingContinuation": false,
