        "answer": "In the first 10 s the cars acceleration is 2.5 m/s², from 10 s to 40 s it is 0 m/s², while in the last 5 s it is -5 m/s², the negative gradient indicates that the car is slowing down.\nTotal distance = 937.5 m.\nThe average speed of the car is 20.8 m/s",
