            "text": "Since ΔP⃗ = P⃗_f − P⃗_i, therefore F⃗ = ΔP⃗/Δt (3.5). Hence the time rate of change of linear momentum of a body is equal to the net force acting on the body. This means that for sudden change in momentum force is large and vice versa.",
