            "text": "GIVEN: m₁=0.05 kg; m₂=0.20 kg; u₁=0.50 m/s; u₂=0 m/s; v₁=−0.30 m/s. REQUIRED: v₂=? By conservation m₁v₁+m₂v₂=m₁u₁+m₂u₂. Rearranging m₂v₂=m₁u₁+m₂u₂−m₁v₁; dividing by m₂: v₂=(m₁u₁+m₂u₂−m₁v₁)/m₂. Putting values: v₂=(0.05×0.50+0.20×0−0.05×−0.30)/0.20=(0.025+0+0.015)/0.20=0.04/0.20=0.2 m/s. Velocity of ball B after collision is 0.2 m/s.",
