        "solution": "(a) ΔT₁ = −5 − 20 = −25 K; Δl₁ = 12 × 10⁻⁶ × 200 × (−25) = −6 × 10⁻² m = −6 cm\n(b) ΔT₂ = 50 − 20 = 30 K; Δl₂ = 12 × 10⁻⁶ × 200 × 30 = 7.2 × 10⁻² m = 7.2 cm\nTotal range for expansion joints = 7.2 cm + 6 cm = 13.2 cm",
        "answer": "Contracts 6 cm, expands 7.2 cm (range 13.2 cm)",
        "solutionOrigin": "textbook",
